Hi {Owner},

I build websites and patient software for fertility and IVF clinics. {Business Name} has a strong reputation, but on a phone the site is slow, the fees sit in a PDF and booking a consult means calling during office hours.

I built a sample rather than ask for your time: pathway pages for IVF and egg freezing, a cost page by package, a page per monitoring site and a private consult booking by physician, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I finish it on your domain for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, security updates and edits. Your medical director approves every page, and nothing makes an outcome claim. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would thirty minutes with you and your marketing lead be worth it?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
